==Strategy==
Because of the only 2 cats [[Restriction Stage|restriction]], the 200% buff of the Ginger Snaches and the 1,000% buff of the one horns, powerful Anti Red Cats should be brought along. Those should either be a combination of a tank and damage dealer, such as [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] + [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Elemental Duelist]], or a pair of more all-rounded units, such as [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island cat]], [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale]] or [[Viking Cat (Rare Cat)|Maximum the Fighter]], to name a few.

